[{"answer":"Dave, I'm worried about our case study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I've done a bit of reading, but I'm not sure what's involved in actually writing a case study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I missed the lecture where Dr Baker talked us through it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/3.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well it's quite straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/4.mp3"},{"answer":"We've got our focus - that's tourism at the Horton Castle site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/5.mp3"},{"answer":"And you said you'd done some reading about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I found some articles and made notes of the main points.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you remember to keep a record of where you got the information from?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I know what a pain it is when you forget that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/10.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so we can compare what we've read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we have to decide on a particular problem or need at our site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And then think about who we're going to interview to get more information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/13.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/14.mp3"},{"answer":"So who'd that be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/15.mp3"},{"answer":"The people who work there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And presumably some of the tourists too?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, both those groups.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So we'll have to go to the site to do that, I suppose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/19.mp3"},{"answer":"But we might also do some of our interviewing away from the site -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/20.mp3"},{"answer":"we could even contact some people here in the city,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/21.mp3"},{"answer":"like administrators involved in overseeing tourism.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/22.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. So we'll need to think about our interview questions and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/23.mp3"},{"answer":"fix times and places for the meetings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/24.mp3"},{"answer":"It's all going to take a lot of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And if we can, we should ask our interviewees if they can bring along some numerical data","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/26.mp3"},{"answer":"that we can add to support our findings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/27.mp3"},{"answer":"And photographs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I think we have plenty of those already.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/29.mp3"},{"answer":"But Dr Baker also said","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/30.mp3"},{"answer":"we have to establish with our interviewees whether we can identify them in our case study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/31.mp3"},{"answer":"or whether they want to be anonymous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I wouldn't have thought of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/33.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, once we've got all this information, I suppose we have to analyse it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, put it all together and choose what's relevant to the problem we're focusing on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and analyse that carefully to find out if we can identify any trends or regularities there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the main thing at this stage, rather than concentrating on details or lots of facts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/37.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And then once we've analysed that, what next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, then we need to think about what we do with the data we've selected","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/39.mp3"},{"answer":"to make it as clear as possible to our readers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like graphs, or tables, or charts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the case study itself is mostly quite standard;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/43.mp3"},{"answer":"we begin by presenting the problem, and giving some background,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/44.mp3"},{"answer":"then go through the main sections,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/45.mp3"},{"answer":"but the thing that surprised me is that in a normal report","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/46.mp3"},{"answer":"we'd end with some suggestions to deal with the problem or need we identified,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/47.mp3"},{"answer":"but in a case study we end up with a question or a series of questions to our readers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and they decide what ought to be done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I hadn't realised that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So basically, the problem we're addressing in our case study of the Horton Castle site","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/51.mp3"},{"answer":"is why so few tourists are visiting it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'll find out more from our interviews,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/53.mp3"},{"answer":"but I did find one report on the internet that suggested that one reason might be because...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/54.mp3"},{"answer":"as far as transport goes, access is difficult.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I read that too, but that report was actually written ten years ago,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/56.mp3"},{"answer":"when the road there was really bad, but that's been improved now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/57.mp3"},{"answer":"And I think there's plenty of fascinating stuff there for a really good day out,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but you'd never realise it from the castle website -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/59.mp3"},{"answer":"maybe that's the problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's really dry and boring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I read somewhere a suggestion that what the castle needs is a visitor centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/62.mp3"},{"answer":"So we could have a look for some information about that on the internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/63.mp3"},{"answer":"What would we need to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, who'd use it for a start.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/65.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd be good to know what categories the visitors fell into too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/66.mp3"},{"answer":"like school parties or retired people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/67.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think we'd have to talk to staff to get that information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/68.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. And as we're thinking of suggesting a visitor centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/69.mp3"},{"answer":"we'd also have to look at potential problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/70.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, obviously it wouldn't be cheap to set up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/71.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but it could be a really good investment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And as it's on a historical site it'd need to get special planning permission, I expect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/73.mp3"},{"answer":"That might be hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, especially as the only possible place for it would be at the entrance,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/75.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's right in front of the castle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/76.mp3"},{"answer":"But it could be a good thing for the town of Horton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/77.mp3"},{"answer":"At present it's a bit of a ghost town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Once they've left school and got any skills or qualifications,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/79.mp3"},{"answer":"the young people all get out as fast as they can to get jobs in the city,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/80.mp3"},{"answer":"and the only people left are children and those who've retired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Something else we could investigate would be the potential damage that tourists might cause to the castle site,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/83.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean their environmental impact.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/84.mp3"},{"answer":"At present the tourists can just wander round wherever they want,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/85.mp3"},{"answer":"but if numbers increase, there might have to be some restrictions, like sticking to marked ways.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/86.mp3"},{"answer":"And there'd need to be guides and wardens around to make sure these were enforced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we could look at that too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/88.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-3-part-3-2023-05-22-08-13-43/89.mp3"}]
